@WorkFlow_API_HostAddress = https://localhost:7040

### Cadastrar empresa

POST {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Empresa Testes111",
  "registrationNumber": "REG-API-001222233e",
  "email": "empresa-api@test.local",
  "phone": "(47) 99999-9999"
}

### Tentar cadastrar empresa com nome vazio

POST {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": " ",
  "registrationNumber": "REG-INVALIDO-001",
  "email": "invalida@test.local"
}

### Consultar empresa pelo PublicId

GET {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/908a9309-07d6-4c7f-9446-3085a82a2f8e
Accept: application/json

### Consultar empresa inexistente

GET {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Accept: application/json

### Desativar empresa

PATCH {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/185f2285-260c-4f28-bdd9-d85496219e07/status
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "isActive": false
}

### Consultar empresa desativada

GET {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/185f2285-260c-4f28-bdd9-d85496219e07
Accept: application/json

### Reativar empresa

PATCH {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/185f2285-260c-4f28-bdd9-d85496219e07/status
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "isActive": true
}

### Alterar status de empresa inexistente

PATCH {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa/status
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "isActive": false
}

### Alterar status com PublicId vazio

PATCH {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/status
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "isActive": false
}

### Atualizar empresa existente

PUT {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/185f2285-260c-4f28-bdd9-d85496219e07
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Empresa Testes Atualizada",
  "email": "empresa-atualizada@test.local",
  "phone": "(47) 98888-7777"
}

### Consultar empresa atualizada

GET {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/185f2285-260c-4f28-bdd9-d85496219e07
Accept: application/json

### Atualizar empresa inexistente

PUT {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Empresa Inexistente",
  "email": "inexistente@test.local",
  "phone": null
}

### Atualizar empresa com nome vazio

PUT {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/185f2285-260c-4f28-bdd9-d85496219e07
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "   ",
  "email": "empresa-atualizada@test.local",
  "phone": "(47) 98888-7777"
}

### Atualizar empresa com e-mail vazio

PUT {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/185f2285-260c-4f28-bdd9-d85496219e07
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Empresa Testes Atualizada",
  "email": "   ",
  "phone": "(47) 98888-7777"
}

### Remover telefone da empresa

PUT {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/185f2285-260c-4f28-bdd9-d85496219e07
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Empresa Testes Atualizada",
  "email": "empresa-atualizada@test.local",
  "phone": null
}

### Confirmar remoção do telefone

GET {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/185f2285-260c-4f28-bdd9-d85496219e07
Accept: application/json